<title>BRAZIL: Brazil shares end modestly higher in seesaw trade.</title>
<headline>Brazil shares end modestly higher in seesaw trade.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian stocks ended slightly higher in light seesaw trade ahead of Monday's options settlements, brokers said.</p>
<p>The Bovespa index of the 49 most traded shares rose 194 points to 68,559 points at the close. Volume was low at 143.89 million reais ($138.8 million).</p>
</text>
